<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ACC Corp rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ACC Corp rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Linda Meltzer intiated coverage of telecommunications provider ACC Corp with a buy rating and a six-to-12-month $40 price target.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 1/2 to 31-3/4.</p>
